{"version":1,"content":"<p>「樂壇小天后」炎明熹（Gigi）與內地「海豚音天后」張靚穎昨晚在內地演出《潮音風暴超級演唱會．清遠站》，分別以一靜一動的風格展現在舞台上的魅力，為樂迷帶來視聽盛宴。</p><p>Gigi穿上一條連身長裙上陣獻唱《風旅》，大騷唱功，唱得投入，更舉V與觀眾影</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.565070+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T16:01:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"fc0d98a168949173747c81c937aff01269ee1c74a12c26ac49587d6a41af8d4c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}